Package: costablr
Title: Sparse and Reliable Biomarker Discovery in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "costablr", family = "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: R implementation of STABL for sparse and reliable biomarker
    discovery. Provides glmnet-based stability selection, FDP+ thresholding,
    artificial-feature controls, grouped bootstrapping, multi-omic early,
    late, and cooperative fusion workflows, visualization helpers, and
    export utilities without a Python or tidymodels runtime dependency.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/gregbellan/Stabl,
    https://gregbellan.github.io/Stabl/costablr
BugReports: https://github.com/gregbellan/Stabl/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    glmnet,
    Rcpp,
    stats,
    utils
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
